  "captions": {
    "tiktok": "112 pages and you're in two scenes. Ghost Light scans the script and builds only yours. #actorslife #actortok #rehearsal #theatre #actors",
    "youtube_title": "112 pages. You're in two scenes. #shorts",
    "youtube_description": "Bring the whole script to Ghost Light. It lists every scene, you tick only yours, and it builds just those.\nA scene moved to another act? Tap its pencil and move it. Built by a working actor.\n#actorslife #rehearsal #theatre #acting",
    "instagram": "First read-through of The Rivals. 112 pages. You play Lucy, and Lucy is in two scenes.\n1. Open Ghost Light, tap Scene, add the whole script.\n2. It lists every scene. Tick only yours.\n3. A scene moves to Act One? Tap its pencil and move it.\nBuilt by a working actor. Link in bio.\n#actorslife #rehearsal #theatre #actorsofinstagram #actortraining"
  },
